[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0846","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0846.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21383","title":"Microsoft Excel 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 存在越界读取（Out-of-bounds Read，CWE-125）漏洞，由于程序在处理特制 Excel 文件时未正确验证内存边界，导致攻击者可读取越界内存中的敏感信息。攻击者需诱使用户打开恶意构造的 Excel 文件（用户交互为必要条件），成功利用后可泄露目标系统内存中的机密数据，进而可能结合其他漏洞实现进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise、Excel 2016、Office 2019、Office LTSC 2021 及 Office LTSC 2024（含 macOS 版本）。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21383"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新。对于 Windows 版 Microsoft 365/Office，通过「文件→账户→更新选项→立即更新」获取最新补丁；对于 Office for Mac，通过「帮助→检查更新」安装最新版本。无法立即更新的用户应避免打开来自不可信来源的 Excel 文件，并启用受保护的视图（默认开启）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21383","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21383/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2025/CVE-2025-21383.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21383/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0846.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0844","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0844.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21381","title":"Microsoft Excel 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 存在远程代码执行漏洞，由于软件在处理特制文件时未正确验证内存中的对象，导致攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意构造的 Excel 文件来触发漏洞。成功利用该漏洞的攻击者可在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码，实现数据窃取、恶意软件安装或系统控制。该漏洞需用户交互（打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即安装更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21381"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新：Excel 2016 升级至 16.0.5487.1000 及以上版本，Office Online Server 升级至 16.0.10416.20058 及以上版本，Mac 版 Office LTSC 升级至 16.94.25020927 及以上版本。Microsoft 365 及 Office 2019/2021/2024 LTSC 用户通过 https://aka.ms/OfficeSecurityReleases 获取更新。临时缓解措施：不要打开来自不可信来源的 Excel 文件，启用受保护视图和文件阻止策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21381","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21381/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21381.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21381/poc.py","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ed64b4e31209e933908eff50d33cf701402ff24/2025/CVE-2025-21381.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0844.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0844.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0842","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0842.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21379","title":"Microsoft Windows DHCP 客户端服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows DHCP 客户端服务存在使用后释放（Use-After-Free，CWE-416）漏洞。攻击者需与目标位于同一网络段，通过发送特制的 DHCP 响应报文，在客户端处理响应时触发对已释放内存的非法访问，从而导致远程代码执行。该攻击需要用户交互且攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。影响 Windows 11 24H2 及 Windows Server 2025 等版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21379"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051987），将 Windows 11 24H2 升级至 10.0.26100.3194 及以上版本，Windows Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3194 及以上版本。无法立即打补丁时，限制 DHCP 服务对不可信网络段的暴露，并禁用不必要的 DHCP 中继代理以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21379","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21379/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2025/CVE-2025-21379.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21379/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0842.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0840","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0840.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21377","title":"Microsoft Windows NTLM 哈希泄露欺骗漏洞","description":"Windows NTLM 哈希泄露欺骗漏洞（CVE-2025-21377）存在于 Windows NTLM 身份认证协议中，攻击者可通过构造恶意的认证请求或中间人攻击方式，诱使用户与攻击者控制的服务器进行 NTLM 认证交互，从而窃取用户的 NTLM 哈希值。获取的 NTLM 哈希可被攻击者离线破解或用于 NTLM 中继攻击，进而冒充用户身份访问受保护资源。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或访问恶意服务器），影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21377"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，更新后系统版本号需达到：Windows 10 1507 ≥ 10.0.10240.20915、Windows 10 1607 ≥ 10.0.14393.7785、Windows 10 1809 ≥ 10.0.17763.6893、Windows 11 24H2 ≥ 10.0.26100.3194 等。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制用户点击不可信链接，并启用受保护视图。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21377","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21377/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21377/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2025/CVE-2025-21377.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21377"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0840.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0840.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0839","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0839.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21376","title":"Microsoft Windows LDAP 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 轻量级目录访问协议（LDAP）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于整数下溢（CWE-191）及竞争条件（CWE-362）缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 LDAP 服务发送特制数据包触发堆溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 全版本及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019/2022/2025 等广泛版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。攻击复杂度较高但无需用户交互，成功利用可完全控制目标系统。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21376"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:13Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974，该更新修复了 Windows LDAP 远程代码执行漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在域控防火墙限制对 LDAP 服务（389/TCP、636/TCP）的未授权访问，并启用 LDAP 签名/通道绑定作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21376","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21376/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21376/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21376.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21376","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2025/CVE-2025-21376.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0839.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0838","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0838.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21375","title":"Microsoft Windows Kernel Streaming WOW Thunk 服务驱动程序特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Kernel Streaming WOW Thunk 服务驱动程序存在输入验证不当漏洞，导致权限提升。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过向受影响系统发送特制的 IOCTL 请求触发内核态内存操作异常，从而将自身权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21375"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:13Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新获取修复。该漏洞为本地提权，需攻击者已获得低权限访问，临时缓解措施可限制非授权用户登录系统并监控异常进程加载 ks.sys/ksproxy.ax 等内核流驱动模块的行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21375","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21375/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21375/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21375.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21375","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2025/CVE-2025-21375.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0838.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0838.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0836","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0836.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21373","title":"Microsoft Windows Installer 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Installer 在处理 MSI 安装包时存在链接跟踪漏洞（CWE-59），本地低权限攻击者可通过创建符号链接诱导 Windows Installer 以 SYSTEM 权限写入目标文件，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可利用。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21373"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）。各受影响版本的最低修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20915，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7785，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.6893，Windows 10 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5487，Windows 10 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5487，Windows 11 22H2/23H2 升级至 10.0.22621.4890/10.0.22631.4890，Windows 11 24H2/Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3194，Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3207，Server 2022 23H2 升级至 10.0.25398.1425。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户登录权限并启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少（ASR）规则以缓解利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21373","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21373.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21373.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21373.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21373.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21373/README.md","https://github.com/