立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051987（Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 对应版本），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。Windows Server 用户可安装热补丁 KB5052105。如无法立即打补丁，可在域控和客户端上禁用 Digest 身份验证（通过组策略关闭 \"Digest authentication\" 或注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\SecurityProviders\\Digest 中 DisableDigestAuth 设为 1）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21368","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21368/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21368/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2025/CVE-2025-21368.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21368"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0830.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0829","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0829.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21367","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32 内核子系统特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32 内核子系统存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，该漏洞源于内核对象在释放后未正确清理指针引用，导致攻击者可利用已释放的内存空间执行任意代码。已获得低权限的本地攻击者通过运行特制的应用程序即可触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 SYSTEM 权限，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21367"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:12Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取补丁。受影响系统包括 Windows 10 1809/21H2/22H2、Windows 11 22H2/23H2/24H2、Windows Server 2019/2022/2025，更新后各版本对应修复版本号分别为 10.0.17763.6893、10.0.19044.5487、10.0.19045.5487、10.0.22621.4890、10.0.22631.4890、10.0.26100.3194、10.0.20348.3207。临时缓解措施：限制低权限用户登录受影响的 Windows 系统，并启用 Microsoft Defender for Endpoint 的行为监控以检测内核利用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21367","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2025-21367.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21367/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2025/CVE-2025-21367.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21367/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0829.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0820","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0820.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21359","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows 内核存在安全功能绕过漏洞（CWE-284 权限管理不当），低权限攻击者可在本地利用该漏洞绕过内核安全机制，获取系统级权限，实现完全控制目标主机的机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击无需用户交互，复杂度低，但需本地访问能力。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21359"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 全系列及 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022/2025，更新后各版本对应内核版本分别为 10.0.10240.20915 (1507)、10.0.19045.5487 (22H2)、10.0.22621.4890 (11 22H2)、10.0.26100.3194 (11 24H2) 等。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户登录权限并启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少 (ASR) 规则以降低绕过风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21359/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2025/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21359/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21359.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21359"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0820.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0819","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0819.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21358","title":"Microsoft Windows Core Messaging 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Core Messaging 组件存在不受信任指针解引用漏洞（CWE-822），由于对用户态传入的指针参数缺乏有效验证，导致攻击者可利用该漏洞在内核上下文中解引用任意内存地址。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制的 Core Messaging 消息触发此漏洞，实现权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（KB5051974）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21358"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 KB5051974（适用于 Windows 10 22H2/21H2，OS Builds 19044.5487 和 19045.5487）或对应 Windows Server 版本的更新 KB5052000（OS Build 17763.6893）。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。该漏洞需本地低权限用户交互触发，建议同时遵循最小权限原则，限制非管理员用户的本地登录权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21358"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0819.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0814","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0814.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21352","title":"Microsoft Internet Connection Sharing (ICS) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Internet 连接共享（ICS）组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，其根源在于 ICS 服务对特制网络数据包的处理不当，导致资源消耗失控（CWE-400）。未经身份认证的攻击者在同一相邻网络段上，无需用户交互即可向目标系统的 ICS 服务发送特制数据包，触发该漏洞，导致目标系统服务停止响应或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新（5051974）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21352"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 多版本及 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022/2025，各版本对应的修复版本号分别为 10.0.10240.20915 (1507)、10.0.14393.7785 (1607)、10.0.17763.6893 (1809)、10.0.19044.5487 (21H2)、10.0.19045.5487 (22H2)、10.0.22621.4890 (22H2)、10.0.22631.4890 (23H2)、10.0.26100.3194 (24H2)。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对 ICS 服务的网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21352","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21352/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/17e962b373a9dbef6aa7b426a0062ee15f6ee207/2025/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21352/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21352.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21352"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0814.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0813","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0813.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21351","title":"Microsoft Windows Active Directory 域服务 API 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Active Directory 域服务（AD DS）API 存在资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标域控制器发送特制的 API 请求，导致系统资源被过度消耗，从而使 Active Directory 服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21351"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 2 月安全更新 (KB5051974)，通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取。如无法立即打补丁，可在域控制器上配置防火墙规则限制对 AD DS API 端口的非信任来源访问，并监控异常 LDAP 请求流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21351","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21351/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/17e962b373a9dbef6aa7b426a0062ee15f6ee207/2025/CVE-2025-21351.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2025/CVE-2025-21351/poc.py","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21351.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0813.toml"}]